    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_Festival_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Th-they've all been knocked out? I... never knew you were so powerful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've thought about it before, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why I didn't want you to know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But that was amazing! You're really cool, Schwarz!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How'd you jump that high?! You ran up the wall and did a somersault!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you spun around in midair and dodged all their shots!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you turned around, and bang bang! You took them all out just like that! My goodness!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Milady... You're making me blush.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But Schwarz, there is one thing I have to correct. I wasn't giving you an order. That was just a request from a friend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you ever need anything from me, just tell me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? What did I just say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no need to talk like that! We're friends, friends!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... sure then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha! Let's head to the City Hall now. I wonder how Rhodes Island is doing...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_offce"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_023_2#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "These imbeciles... They can't even stop a little girl?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_020",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But she's a Sarkazian! Plus, there are several others with her!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin's Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_023_2#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's only a handful of them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "text": "D-damn it! What is Rhodes Island doing here?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_290_vigna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh... Feels like these guys are even weaker than Originium slugs...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vigna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_023_2#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Call everyone over here right now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, Mister Cronin...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin's Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think numbers are going to help!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin's Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_023_2#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "No such thing! Don't you dare take a step back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_290_vigna"
    },
    {
        "text": "*yawn*... Hey Doctor, did you find it yet? I still want to go see that concert. We're going to miss it if we take too long here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vigna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I've got it!;......;Mhm. I've already found the logbooks and bonds.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_290_vigna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? You found it? See, beating some sense into them works after all. Meteorite was right. Sometimes, violence solves everything!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vigna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_023_2#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "D-Damn it all!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever. As long as I can get out of here, it's easy enough to forge a registration.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_290_vigna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, Doctor, he jumped out from the window!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vigna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Let's take everything with us!",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_290_vigna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vigna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm, the General is still out there, right? I feel like this Cronin is going to have a tragic end... It would've been better for him to stay inside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vigna"
    },
    {
        "text": "C'mon, Doctor, I'll help you out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vigna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_Festival_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_023_2#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "*gasp* *gasp*... Damn it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've got... to call the others back right now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Last time, it was Miss Ceylon and the Doctor of Rhodes Island jumping out from that window.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "text": "This time, it's you. Karma is poetic, isn't it, Mister Cronin?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "text": "These things happen in life, sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You... You! What'd you do to them? What'd you do to them?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They'd be an eyesore to the beautiful view here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way, you've kept these young ladies waiting for quite some time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
        "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_023_2#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Schwarz...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "text": "You two are standing together, which means...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "In other words, you're toast.;......;You can't escape the law. We have all the evidence.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, please be careful. He may make one last desperate attempt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_023_2#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn you... All of you...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your plot has been exposed, Cronin!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
